<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 7.64 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rate drops to 7.64 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar dropped to 7.64 percent on Wednesday from 8.65 percent on Tuesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said eight banks traded on the market in 23 reported transactions with a total value of 25.35 million dinars ($36 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
